arithmetic with simplicial module maps -- perform arithmetic operations on simplicial module maps
*************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        f + g
        a + f
        f + a
        -f
        f - g
        a - f
        f - a
        a * f
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note Map of Simplicial Modules: SimplicialModuleMap,, 
      * g, a *note Map of Simplicial Modules: SimplicialModuleMap,, 
      * a, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, that is, an
        element in the underlying ring or a number
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Map of Simplicial Modules: SimplicialModuleMap,, 

The set of simplicial module maps forms a module over the underlying *note
ring: ring_lpSimplicialModule_rp,. These methods implement the basic operations
of addition, subtraction, and scalar multiplication.

