forgetDegeneracy(SimplicialModule) -- forget the data of degeneracy maps of a simplicial object
***********************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note forgetDegeneracy: forgetDegeneracy_lpSimplicialModule_rp,
  * Usage: 
        forgetDegeneracy(S)
  * Inputs:
      * S, a *note Simplicial Module: SimplicialModule,, A simplicial module
        whose degeneracy maps are to be forgotten.
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Simplicial Module: SimplicialModule,, The simplicial module S,
        but with no degeneracy maps stored.

Description
===========

This function removes the data of degeneracy maps from a simplicial module `S`.
It is useful when the user wants to ignore degeneracy maps for the purpose of
speeding up computations or simplifying the simplicial object.

