inducedMap(...,Degree=>...) -- specify the degree of an induced map of simplicial modules
*****************************************************************************************

Description
===========

When constructing an induced map of simplicial modules, this option specifies
the degree of the resulting map. By default, the degree is 0.

See also
========

  * *note inducedMap(SimplicialModule,SimplicialModule):
    inducedMap_lpSimplicialModule_cmSimplicialModule_rp, -- make the map of
    simplicial modules induced at each term by the identity map

