Making maps between simplicial modules -- information about the basic constructors
**********************************************************************************

Basic constructors
==================

  * *note map(SimplicialModule,SimplicialModule,HashTable):
    map_lpSimplicialModule_cmSimplicialModule_cmHashTable_rp, -- make a map of
    simplicial modules
  * *note map(SimplicialModule,SimplicialModule,ZZ):
    map_lpSimplicialModule_cmSimplicialModule_cmZZ_rp, -- make the zero map or
    identity between simplicial modules
  * *note map(SimplicialModule,SimplicialModule,SimplicialModuleMap):
    map_lpSimplicialModule_cmSimplicialModule_cmSimplicialModuleMap_rp, -- make
    a new map of simplicial modules, induced from an existing one
  * *note id _ SimplicialModule: id _us SimplicialModule, -- the identity map
    of a simplicial module
  * *note face/degeneracy maps of a simplicial module: face/degeneracy maps of
    a simplicial module, -- access the face and degeneracy maps of a simplicial
    module
  * *note SimplicialModuleMap Array: SimplicialModule Array, -- shift a
    simplicial module or simplicial module map
  * *note isWellDefined(SimplicialModuleMap):
    isWellDefined_lpSimplicialModuleMap_rp, -- whether a map of simplicial
    modules is well-defined

Important computations creating new simplicial module maps
==========================================================

  * *note SimplicialModule ** Matrix: SimplicialModule _st_st Matrix, -- create
    the tensor product of a simplicial module and a map of modules

Canonical maps between simplicial modules
=========================================

Some simplicial modules come with canonical maps. These are best accessed using
*note inducedMap: (Macaulay2Doc)inducedMap,.

  * *note kernel(SimplicialModuleMap): kernel_lpSimplicialModuleMap_rp, -- make
    the kernel of a map of simplicial modules
  * *note cokernel(SimplicialModuleMap): cokernel_lpSimplicialModuleMap_rp, --
    make the cokernel of a map of simplicial modules
  * *note image(SimplicialModuleMap): image_lpSimplicialModuleMap_rp, -- make
    the image of a map of simplicial modules
  * *note coimage(SimplicialModuleMap): coimage_lpSimplicialModuleMap_rp, --
    make the coimage of a map of simplicial modules
  * *note inducedMap(SimplicialModule,SimplicialModule):
    inducedMap_lpSimplicialModule_cmSimplicialModule_rp, -- make the map of
    simplicial modules induced at each term by the identity map

Random maps of simplicial modules
=================================

The method *note randomSimplicialMap(SimplicialModule,SimplicialModule):
randomSimplicialMap_lpSimplicialModule_cmSimplicialModule_rp, allows one to
construct random simplicial module maps, random morphisms between simplicial
modules, and random null homotopies between simplicial modules.

  * *note isCommutative(SimplicialModuleMap):
    isCommutative_lpSimplicialModuleMap_rp, -- whether a simplicial module map
    commutes with the face/degeneracy maps
  * *note isSimplicialMorphism(SimplicialModuleMap):
    isSimplicialMorphism_lpSimplicialModuleMap_rp, -- whether a simplicial
    module map is a morphism of simplicial modules

Elementary operations on simplicial module maps
===============================================

  * *note arithmetic with simplicial module maps: arithmetic with simplicial
