Making simplicial modules -- information about the basic constructors
*********************************************************************

Basic constructors
==================

  * *note simplicialModule(HashTable,HashTable,HashTable,ZZ): simplicialModule,
    -- make a simplicial module
  * *note simplicialModule(Module,ZZ): simplicialModule_lpModule_cmZZ_rp, --
    make a simplicial module associated to a complex concentrated in degree 0
  * *note SimplicialModule Array: SimplicialModule Array, -- shift a simplicial
    module or simplicial module map
  * *note isWellDefined(SimplicialModule): isWellDefined_lpSimplicialModule_rp,
    -- whether a simplicial module is well-defined

Important computations creating new simplicial modules
======================================================

  * *note simplicialModule(Complex): The Dold-Kan Correspondence in Macaulay2,
    -- compute the image of a non-negatively graded complex under the Dold-Kan
    correspondence
  * *note simplicialTensor(Complex,Complex): simplicialTensor, -- compute the
    simplicial tensor product and cache direct sum indices for easy access

More advanced constructors
==========================

  * *note SimplicialModule ++ SimplicialModule:
    directSum_lpSimplicialModule_rp, -- direct sum of simplicial modules
  * *note SimplicialModule ** SimplicialModule: SimplicialModule _st_st
    SimplicialModule, -- tensor product of simplicial modules
  * *note RingMap SimplicialModule: RingMap SimplicialModule, -- apply a ring
    map to a simplicial module
  * *note RingMap ** SimplicialModule: RingMap _st_st SimplicialModule, --
    tensor a simplicial module along a ring map
  * *note minimalPresentation(SimplicialModule):
    minimalPresentation_lpSimplicialModule_rp, -- minimal presentation of all
    terms in a simplicial module
  * *note truncate(List,SimplicialModule):
    truncate_lpList_cmSimplicialModule_rp, -- truncation of a simplicial module
    at a specified degree or set of degrees

Extracting simplicial modules from simplicial maps
==================================================

