map(...,Degree=>...) -- specify the degree of a map of simplicial modules
*************************************************************************

Description
===========

When constructing a map of simplicial modules, this option specifies the degree
$d$ of the resulting map.  A map of degree $d$ consists of component maps $f_i
: C_i \to D_{i+d}$. By default, the degree is 0.

See also
========

  * *note map(SimplicialModule,SimplicialModule,HashTable):
    map_lpSimplicialModule_cmSimplicialModule_cmHashTable_rp, -- make a map of
    simplicial modules

