========================

  * "naiveNorm(Complex,ZZ)"
  * "naiveNorm(SimplicialModule)"
  * *note naiveNorm(SimplicialModule,ZZ): naiveNorm_lpSimplicialModule_cmZZ_rp,
    -- compute the naive normalization of a simplicial object
