ring(SimplicialModule) -- access the ring of a simplicial module or a simplicial module map
*******************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)ring,
  * Usage: 
        ring C
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note Simplicial Module: SimplicialModule,, or a *note
        SimplicialModuleMap: SimplicialModuleMap,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 

Description
===========

Every simplicial module or simplicial module map has a base ring.  This
function accesses that information.

+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = ZZ/101[a,b,c,d];                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : C = simplicialModule freeResolution coker vars S|
|                                                     |
|      1      5      15      35      70               |
|o2 = S  <-- S  <-- S   <-- S   <-- S  <-- ...        |
|                                                     |
|     0      1      2       3       4                 |
|                                                     |
|o2 : SimplicialModule                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : ring C                                          |
|                                                     |
|o3 = S                                               |
|                                                     |
|o3 : PolynomialRing                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : assert(ring C === S)                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : ring id_C                                       |
|                                                     |
|o5 = S                                               |
|                                                     |
|o5 : PolynomialRing                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : assert(ring id_C === S)                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------+

