Caveat
======

As many of the above examples show, this method can quickly become
computationally infeasible when the modules in the complex have too big of
rank. This seems to stem more from the efficiency of the *note schur:
(SchurFunctors)schur, method, since methods such as the tensor product still
run very quickly even with huge matrices.

