SimplicialModule ** Matrix -- create the tensor product of a simplicial module and a map of modules
***************************************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note **: (Macaulay2Doc)_st_st,
  * Usage: 
        h = C ** f
        h = f ** C
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note Simplicial Module: SimplicialModule,, over a ring $R$
      * f, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, defining a homomorphism from
        the $R$-module $M$ to the $R$-module $N$
  * Outputs:
      * h, a *note Map of Simplicial Modules: SimplicialModuleMap,, from $C
        \otimes M$ to $C \otimes N$

Description
===========

For any simplicial module $C$, a map $f \colon M \to N$ of $R$-modules induces
a morphism $C \otimes f$ of simplicial modules from $C \otimes M$ to $C \otimes
N$.  This method returns this map of simplicial modules.

+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
