Tensoring with a simplicial module defines a functor from the category of
$R$-modules to the category of simplicial modules over $R$.

+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|i15 : f'' = random(source f', R^{-2,-2})                      |
|                                                              |
|o15 = {1} | -28a-47b+38c+2d  -16a+7b+15c-23d |                |
