SimplicialModule ** SimplicialModule -- tensor product of simplicial modules
****************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note **: (Macaulay2Doc)_st_st,
  * Usage: 
        D = C1 ** C2
  * Inputs:
      * C1, a *note Simplicial Module: SimplicialModule,, or a *note module:
        (Macaulay2Doc)Module,
      * C2, a *note Simplicial Module: SimplicialModule,, or a *note module:
        (Macaulay2Doc)Module,
  * Outputs:
      * D, a *note Simplicial Module: SimplicialModule,, tensor product of C1
        and C2

Description
===========

The tensor product is a simplicial module $D$ whose $i$th component is the
tensor product of the degree i components of $C1$ and $C2$. The face/degeneracy
maps are given by the tensor products of the face and degeneracy maps of the
original objects.

As the next example illustrates, the simplicial tensor product in general does
not normalize to give an object that is isomorphic to the classically defined
tensor product of complexes.

+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = ZZ/101[a..c]                                                      |
|                                                                           |
|o1 = S                                                                     |
|                                                                           |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                        |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : Ca = simplicialModule(complex {matrix{{a}}}, 3)                       |
|                                                                           |
|      1      2      3      4                                               |
|o2 = S  <-- S  <-- S  <-- S <-- ...                                        |
|                                                                           |
|     0      1      2      3                                                |
|                                                                           |
|o2 : SimplicialModule                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
