SimplicialModule == SimplicialModule -- whether two simplicial modules are equal
********************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note ==: (Macaulay2Doc)==,
  * Usage: 
        C == D
        C == 0
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note Simplicial Module: SimplicialModule,, 
      * D, a *note Simplicial Module: SimplicialModule,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, that is true when C and
        D are equal

Description
===========

Two simplicial modules are equal if the corresponding objects and corresponding
maps at each index are equal.

+-------------------------------------------------------------+
