Caveat
======

Testing for equality is not the same as testing for isomorphism.

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note SimplicialModule == SimplicialModule: SimplicialModule ==
    SimplicialModule, -- whether two simplicial modules are equal
  * "SimplicialModule == ZZ"
  * "ZZ == SimplicialModule"
