SimplicialModule _ Array -- the canonical inclusion or projection map of a direct sum
*************************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note _: (Macaulay2Doc)_us,
  * Usage: 
        i = C_[name]
        p = C^[name]
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note Simplicial Module: SimplicialModule,, 
