simplicialModule(...,Degeneracy=>...) -- whether to compute degeneracy maps
***************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        simplicialModule(..., Degeneracy => true)

Description
===========

If Degeneracy => true, the degeneracy maps are also computed alongside the face
maps. By default, degeneracy maps are not computed.

See also
========

  * *note simplicialModule: simplicialModule, -- make a simplicial module

