    degeneracy maps
  * *note simplicialModule(...,Degeneracy=>...):
    simplicialModule_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmDegeneracy=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, -- whether to
    compute degeneracy maps
  * *note simplicialTensor(...,Degeneracy=>...):
