  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, or *note Ideal:
        (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, or *note Ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,.
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, top degree to compute the
