SimplicialModuleMap ** SimplicialModuleMap -- the map of simplicial modules between tensor simplicial modules
*************************************************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note **: (Macaulay2Doc)_st_st,
  * Usage: 
        h = f ** g
        h = tensor(f, g)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note Map of Simplicial Modules: SimplicialModuleMap,, 
      * g, a *note Map of Simplicial Modules: SimplicialModuleMap,, 
  * Outputs:
      * h, a *note Map of Simplicial Modules: SimplicialModuleMap,, 

Description
===========

The maps $f : C \to D$ and $g : E \to F$ of simplicial modules induces the map
$h = f \otimes g : C \otimes E \to D \otimes F$ defined by $c \otimes e \mapsto
f(c) \otimes g(e)$.

