|i8 : h = f ++ g;|
+----------------+

The four basic maps are the inclusion from each summand of the source and the
projection to each summand of the target.

+---------------------------------+
|i9 : h_[0] == h * (C1 ++ C2)_[0] |
|                                 |
|o9 = true                        |
+---------------------------------+
|i10 : h_[1] == h * (C1 ++ C2)_[1]|
|                                 |
|o10 = true                       |
+---------------------------------+
|i11 : h^[0] == (D1 ++ D2)^[0] * h|
|                                 |
|o11 = true                       |
+---------------------------------+
|i12 : h^[1] == (D1 ++ D2)^[1] * h|
|                                 |
|o12 = true                       |
+---------------------------------+

These can be combined to obtain the blocks of the map of simplicial modules.

+--------------------+
|i13 : h_[0]^[0] == f|
|                    |
|o13 = true          |
+--------------------+
|i14 : h_[1]^[1] == g|
|                    |
|o14 = true          |
+--------------------+
|i15 : h_[0]^[1] == 0|
|                    |
|o15 = true          |
+--------------------+
|i16 : h_[1]^[0] == 0|
|                    |
|o16 = true          |
+--------------------+

The default names for the components are the non-negative integers.  However,
one can choose any name.

+-------------------------------------------+
|i17 : h = (chicken => f) ++ (nuggets => g);|
+-------------------------------------------+
|i18 : indices h                            |
|                                           |
|o18 = {chicken, nuggets}                   |
|                                           |
|o18 : List                                 |
+-------------------------------------------+
|i19 : h_[chicken]^[chicken] == f           |
|                                           |
|o19 = true                                 |
+-------------------------------------------+
|i20 : h_[nuggets]^[nuggets] == g           |
|                                           |
|o20 = true                                 |
+-------------------------------------------+

