SimplicialModuleMap _ ZZ -- access individual matrices in a simplicial module map
*********************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note _: (Macaulay2Doc)_us,
  * Usage: 
        f_i
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note Map of Simplicial Modules: SimplicialModuleMap,, 
      * i, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the degree index or a sequence
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, the i-th map

Description
===========

A simplicial module map $f : C \to D$ of degree $d$ is a sequence of maps $f_i
: C_i \to D_{i+d}$. This method allows one to access the individual $f_i$.

